		<RichText x="738" y="255" width="424" height="85" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">弗瑞奥萨以站姿迅速拈弓一发冰箭，造成<span color="#99ffff">60%</span><span>伤害；或以蹲姿发射，造成</span><span color="#99ffff">70%</span><span>伤害。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="738" y="703" width="424" height="114" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">弗瑞奥萨给弓注入冰元素，随后发射三枚极快的追踪箭，造成<span color="#99ffff">90%,18%,9%</span><span>伤害。受</span><span color="#bfdfff">「星烁反应」</span><span>影响后箭失去目标，并会使其眩晕一小会。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="738" y="1375" width="426" height="114" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">弗瑞奥萨遁入地面，在目标处留下「<span textDecoration="underline">阻生根须</span><span>」，</span><span color="#ffdfbf">1.5s</span><span>后现身。根须受</span><span color="#bfdfff">「星烁反应」</span><span>影响后会变矮，受击即可破坏，无论位置。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="739" y="479" width="421" height="56" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">弗瑞奥萨蹲下迅速发射两一枚冰箭，均造成<span color="#99ffff">50%</span><span>伤害。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="738" y="927" width="423" height="56" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">距离较近时，弗瑞奥萨使用下肢进行踢踹攻击，造成<span color="#99ffff">60%</span><span>伤害。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="738" y="1151" width="429" height="114" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">弗瑞奥萨缠根，并在两侧留下根须；同时持续发射7波箭雨，前6波箭雨持续造成<span color="#99ffff">50%,25%,10%,5%</span><span>伤害，第7波箭雨虽迟但痛，造成</span><span color="#99ffff">100%,20%,10%</span><span>伤害。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
