		<RichText x="66" y="1224" width="432" height="39" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.7490196078431373">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="16" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">阻生根须：顶端受到任意攻击即可摧毁，摧毁所有根须使弗瑞奥萨虚弱<span color="#ffeebf">13s</span><span>。</span></p>
			</content>
